WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.100
OBS receives the live Game Capture feed through a VDO.Ninja Source.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:13.800
Source properties select the stream ID and the experimental native receiver.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:20.000
The VDO.Ninja Studio dock adds publish controls and shareable viewer links.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.600
Go Live publishes the OBS program to a second VDO.Ninja stream.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:42.400
A browser viewer is receiving moving video; the dock reports the active
connection.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.470
Stop ends OBS publishing. The independent incoming source continues playing.
